plaintext
* SPICE Netlist for Simple Inverter Circuit

V1 4 0 DC 5V * Voltage source from node 4 to ground, 5V

* PMOS Transistor
M1 4 2 5 5 PMOS *

* NMOS Transistor
M2 5 2 3 3 NMOS *

* Node assignments:
* 4 - Supply Voltage (+5V)
* 2 - VIN
* 5 - VOUT
* 3 - Ground

.model PMOS PMOS
.model NMOS NMOS
.end